#
# A deliberately-deficient counter-example for gmeow:FixtureExternalWidget: an
# instance that MUST be rejected (it carries no gmeow:name carrier the well-formed
# fixture requires). Paired with the well-formed fixture so dimFixturePair can be
# present for the widget term.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/fixture-external-slice/counter/> .

ex:counterWidget
    a gmeow:FixtureExternalWidget .
